# Core commands

## `core.server.info`

Show this server's name and version.

- Kind: query
- Scope: public
- Arguments: none
- Result: `{ name: string; version: string }`

## `core.server.rename`

Rename this server.

- Kind: mutation
- Scope: account
- Arguments: `{ name: string; note?: string }`
- Result: `null`
